## Публичный API `usePlayerSheetState` (не дублировать)

| Метод | Когда |
|-------|--------|
| `open()` | tap mini-bar → `finishOpen()` instant |
| `beginExpandPan()` | mini vertical expand — anchor at closed |
| `beginSheetDrag()` | interrupt snap / modal dismiss pointerdown / re-anchor |
| `applySheetDragDelta(dy)` | finger move from anchor (modal dismiss down) |
| `applySheetDragStep(stepDy)` | incremental expand during active pan |
| `settleDrag(vy, travelY)` | **pointer up only** → `snapToOpen` / `snapToClosed` |
| `cancel()` / `finishClosed()` | close button, cancel paths |
| `recoverInteraction()` | unstick после gesture race (INV-SHEET-009) |
| `stopSnapAnimation()` | before external reset |

**Запрещено** снаружи: `sheetDragY.set`, `setSheetPosition`, локальный `animate(yMotion, …)`.

